by>に<ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えられて<ruby>浅瀬<rp>(</rp><rt>あさせ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>渡<rp>(</rp><rt>わた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">A child on your back may guide you across a ford.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">追う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">追赶；追逐；追捕；跟随；遵循；顺应；跟随；驱赶；赶出；驱逐；驱赶（牲畜等）；（用被动形）被（时间等）逼迫；疲于应付</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211194\">その<ruby>警官<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>泥棒<rp>(</rp><rt>どろぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>追<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The policeman was after the thief.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">応援</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おうえん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">援助；协助；帮助；支援；增援；欢呼助威；加油；声援；支持</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"187498\"><ruby>何事<rp>(</rp><rt>なにごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ころうとも、<ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>応援<rp>(</rp><rt>おうえん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I will stand by you whatever happens.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">応急</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おうきゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang