es can apply for the post.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">応用</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おうよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（实际）应用；付诸实用；应用的（如应用物理学、应用语言学、应用研究等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207191\">その<ruby>発見<rp>(</rp><rt>はっけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいろいろな<ruby>用途<rp>(</rp><rt>ようと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>応用<rp>(</rp><rt>おうよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">We can apply the discovery to various uses.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">終える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">完成；做完；使（某事）结束；毕业；结束；完结；（作补助动词）做完……；完成……</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210334\">その<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をもう<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えましたか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Are you through with the work?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おおい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">喂；嘿；哎（从远处招呼人）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148822\"><ruby>若<rp>(</rp><rt>わか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はおおいに<ruby>有望<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">In his youth, he had shown great promise.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">多い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おおい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">多；众多；许多；大量；许多；频繁；常见</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222596\">この<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>男子<rp>(</rp><rt>だんし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よりも<ruby>女子<rp>(</rp><rt>じょし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There are more girls than boys in this school.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大いに</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おおいに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">很；非常；大大地；相当；高度地；极其；大量地；尽兴地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"153581\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>尊敬<rp>(</rp><rt>そんけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I have a great regard for him.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">覆う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おおう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">覆盖</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"